<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct-Dec output seen up 2.5 pct qtr/qtr-MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct-Dec output seen up 2.5 pct qtr/qtr-MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production in the October-December period is expected to show a quarter-on-quarter increase of 2.5 percent, a senior official of the Ministry of International Trade and Industry told reporters on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official also said the industrial output in the October-December period is seen rising 4.2 percent from a year earlier, the official said.</p>
</text>
